{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"Farms and hectares by crops, utilised agricultural area, economic size of the farm and NUTS 2 region","source":"ESTAT","updated":"2026-06-17T23:00:00+0200","value":{"0":94490,"1":260220,"2":513970,"3":63820},"id":["freq","statinfo","so_eur","uaarea","crops","unit","geo","time"],"size":[1,1,1,1,1,1,4,1],"dimension":{"freq":{"label":"Time frequency","category":{"index":{"A":0},"label":{"A":"Annual"}}},"statinfo":{"label":"Statistical information","category":{"index":{"ABVTH":0},"label":{"ABVTH":"Above threshold"}}},"so_eur":{"label":"Standard output in Euros","category":{"index":{"TOTAL":0},"label":{"TOTAL":"Total"}}},"uaarea":{"label":"Utilised agricultural area","category":{"index":{"TOTAL":0},"label":{"TOTAL":"Total"}}},"crops":{"label":"Crops","category":{"index":{"C1500":0},"label":{"C1500":"Grain maize and corn-cob-mix"}}},"unit":{"label":"Unit of measure","category":{"index":{"HA":0},"label":{"HA":"Hectare"}}},"geo":{"label":"Geopolitical entity (reporting)","category":{"index":{"EL":0,"ES":1,"IT":2,"PT":3},"label":{"EL":"Greece","ES":"Spain","IT":"Italy","PT":"Portugal"}}},"time":{"label":"Time","category":{"index":{"2023":0},"label":{"2023":"2023"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"EN","description":"<p>Land cover statistics on farms show how agricultural land is used allowing to monitor land use change and support agricultural and environmental policy. This table includes information on the number of agricultural holdings and hectares of utilised agricultural area (UAA), by type of crop and land cover category, class of economic output (standard output - SO) of the farm and class of utilised agricultural area (UAA), at regional (NUTS 2) level. The standard output is the average monetary value of the agricultural output at farm-gate price, in euro per hectare or per head of livestock. Information is based on censuses and sample surveys.</p>","id":"EF_LUS_ALLCROPS","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"EF_L